  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/19834c919966288c99419a07884d09739eed61fb7b636905d29e78d8456bb0d3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **+ and ×**\n\n→ 10 × 23 − 3 + **63 ÷ 7** = 70\n\n→ **10 ****×**** 23** − 3 + 9 = 70 \n\n→ **230** − 3 **+ 9** = 70 \n\n→ 239 − 3 = 70\n\n→ 236 ≠ 70\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **− and ×**\n\n→ 10 + 23 × 3 - **63 ÷ 7** = 70\n\n→ 10 + **23 ****×**** 3** - 9 = 70 \n\n→ **10 + 69** - 9 = 70 \n\n→ 79 - 9 = 70 \n\n→ 70 = 70 \n\n→ **LHS = RHS **⇒ **Satisfies the equation**.\n\n3)** ÷ and ×**\n\n→ 10 + 23 − **3 ÷ 63** × 7 = 70\n\n→ 10 + 23 − **1/21 ×**** 7** = 70\n\n→ **10 + 23** − 1/3 = 70\n\n→ 33 − 1/3 ≠ 70\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **− and +**\n\n→ 10 − 23 + 3 × **63 ÷ 7** = 70\n\n→ 10 − 23 + **3 × 9** = 70\n\n→ **10** − 23 +** 27** = 70\n\n→ 37 − 23 = 70 \n\n→ 14 ≠ 70\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\"**.",
